  "content": {
    "id": "v2-8d878845-p73-level-slot-4-lower-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "The numbers of goals scored by a hockey team in five matches were\n\n$2,\\ 3,\\ 3,\\ 5,\\ 7$\n\nIn the sixth match, the team scored $3$ goals. State how the summary statistics change using **“increase, decrease, no change”**",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "v2-8d878845-p73-level-slot-4-lower-slot-4-lower-q-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Mean:",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Mean: decrease.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Mean before}&=\\frac{2+3+3+5+7}{5}=4\\\\\\text{Mean after}&=\\frac{20+3}{6}\\approx3.83\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe mean decreases because the new score, $3$, is below the original mean, $4$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "v2-8d878845-p73-level-slot-4-lower-slot-4-lower-q-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Median:",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Median: no change.",
          "worked": "Before: $2,\\ 3,\\ \\underline{3},\\ 5,\\ 7$, so the median is $3$.\n\nAfter: $2,\\ 3,\\ \\underline{3},\\ \\underline{3},\\ 5,\\ 7$, so the median is $\\frac{3+3}{2}=3$.\n\nThe median does not change.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "v2-8d878845-p73-level-slot-4-lower-slot-4-lower-q-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Range:",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Range: no change.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range before}&=7-2=5\\\\\\text{Range after}&=7-2=5\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe range does not change because the new score lies between the minimum and maximum.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      }
    ]
  },
